sequenceDiagram
  actor W as Writer
  actor R as Reviewer
  participant FE as Web Studio
  participant API as ScriptService
  participant ST as StemValidationService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  W->>FE: Save STEM Brief & Scene Evidence
  FE->>API: submitForReview(projectId, versionId, draftRevision)
  API->>DB: Lock current script version (PESSIMISTIC_WRITE)
  API->>ST: validateStructureAndInvariants(briefId, scriptVersionId)
  alt Validation findings exist
    ST-->>API: List<StemFinding> (400 Bad Request)
    API-->>FE: 400 with details.findings[]
  else Structure & Invariants Valid
    ST->>ST: computeScriptFingerprint(brief, scenes, policyHash)
    API->>DB: Record StemValidationRun & update status to IN_REVIEW
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Status IN_REVIEW + Fingerprint)
  end

  R->>FE: Inspect Brief, Curriculum Outcomes & Rubric
  FE->>API: approveScript(versionId, criterionResults, fingerprint)
  API->>ST: verifyReviewerSeat(workspaceId, reviewerId)
  API->>ST: recomputeScriptFingerprint(versionId)
  alt Fingerprint Mismatch (Stale)
    API-->>FE: 409 Conflict (STEM_REVIEW_STALE)
  else Fingerprint Matches & Rubric Passed
    API->>DB: Append StemReviewDecision & transition to APPROVED atomically
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Status APPROVED)
  end
